stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued
    queued --> leased: worker claim
    leased --> running: heartbeat starts
    running --> publishing: validated output and assets
    publishing --> succeeded: atomic READY publication
    running --> retry_wait: retryable failure
    retry_wait --> queued: backoff elapsed
    running --> dead_letter: attempts exhausted / non-retryable
    leased --> queued: lease expired
    succeeded --> [*]
    dead_letter --> [*]
